After both joined workers complete, what count is guaranteed?

```java
var count = new java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger();
Thread first = new Thread(() -> { for (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++) count.incrementAndGet(); });
Thread second = new Thread(() -> { for (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++) count.incrementAndGet(); });
first.start(); second.start();
first.join(); second.join();
System.out.println(count.get());
```
